      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُثْخِنٌ</span></b>  (assumed tropical:)  One <i>who exceeds the usual,</i> or <i>the just,
bounds,</i> or <i>who does his utmost, in narration, and
in the rehearsal of sayings.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And, with
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>, (tropical:)  A <i>large, corpulent, fleshy,</i> woman. (JK,
